# A bookmarked project inside the INBOX is listed under Bookmarks though not under Projects, and choosing it zooms there.
file <<END
INBOX:
	Sorted: @bookmark
		- a
	- b
END
keys <C-g>
see Bookmarks
see Sorted                                    1 │
hide Projects
type sorted
keys <Enter>
see 󰋜 › INBOX › Sorted
quit
